{
  "slug": "adup-ai-marketing-agent",
  "name": "Adup Ai Marketing Agent",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AdUp for Claude\nConnect your entire marketing stack to Claude Code. Ask questions about your ad performance in plain English.\n\nWhat you can do:\n\nCross-platform overview — See total spend, ROAS, and performance across all channels at once\nFacebook/Instagram Ads — Campaign analysis, creative fatigue detection, audience breakdowns, learning phase diagnosis\nGoogle Ads — Search, Shopping, and Performance Max analysis, Quality Score diagnostics, impression share\nGoogle Analytics 4 — Sessions, revenue, acquisition channels, funnel drop-off, conversion events\nLinkedIn & TikTok Ads — Platform-specific performance and optimization recommendations\nAd fatigue detection — Spot rising frequency, falling CTR, and creative exhaustion before it hurts\nBudget optimization — Propose budget shifts based on performance data\nExecutive reports — Monday briefings, client-ready reports, anomaly alerts\n\nBuilt for agencies — Switch between clients instantly. Works with HubSpot, Intercom, and Google Search Console too.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **27 skills**, **1 agent** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (27): `ad-fatigue` (Run a daily ad fatigue check across all connected advertising platforms), `ads-overview` (Get a quick cross-platform advertising overview), `analytics` (Analyse Google Analytics 4 data — sessions, revenue, e-commerce, user acquisition by channel, content engagement, funnel drop-off, and…), `anomaly-alerts` (Monitor ad accounts for anomalies every 3 hours), `blended-roas` (Blended ROAS per market — Shopify revenue per country matched to ad spend per country across Facebook, Google…), `budget-tracker` (Monitor budget pacing across Facebook Ads campaigns), `client-report` (Generate polished, client-ready performance reports with executive summaries, data-backed narratives, and account manager talking points), `connect` (Connect your ADUP account and verify which platforms are active), and 19 more\n- **Agents** (1): `adup-analyst` (Senior performance marketing analyst with expertise across Facebook Ads, Google Ads, GA4, LinkedIn Ads, HubSpot, and Intercom)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `adup`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install adup-ai-marketing-agent@claude-community` from `Ad-Up-VC/adup-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 27,
    "agent": 1,
    "mcp": 1
  },
